[00:13.66]To Christ, by our God, Jehovah, we have been drawn
[00:23.86]To be his disciples from now on.
[00:37.17]From Jehovah’s lofty throne,
[00:43.22]How the light of truth has shone.
[00:49.18]In our hearts, our faith has grown;
[00:54.37]Our lives we vow to disown.
[01:00.52](Chorus)
[01:00.67]To God we are dedicated; This is our choice.
[01:13.70]In him and in Jesus we now rejoice.
[01:23.26]In prayer we have come before Jehovah to say
[01:37.62]We’ll serve him forever and obey.
[01:49.24]It’s a joy beyond compare,
[01:55.10]One that we are glad to share,
[02:01.20]As Jehovah’s name we bear,
[02:07.22]And Kingdom truth we declare.
[02:12.94](Chorus)
[02:13.09]To God we are dedicated; This is our choice.
[02:24.10]In him and in Jesus we now rejoice.
